  "No Update control exists in this render: the tab bar holds Home, the file tab and + only (no ink right of source x=707)",
  "Text runs are one bar each at the run's ink-weighted vertical centre; inline arrow glyphs that touch text (the arrows in Required, Icon leading, Icon swap, Colors) are absorbed into that run's bar",
